@startuml
title SPG / Surefyre — Insurance Ecosystem

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam nodesep 55
skinparam ranksep 70

actor "Business Owner\nor Organization" as Insured

rectangle "Retail Insurance\nAgent / Broker" as Agent
rectangle "SPG Specialty Business\nMGA / Wholesaler" as SPG
rectangle "Insurance Carrier" as Carrier

Insured --> Agent : Requests coverage\nProvides risk information
Agent --> SPG : Submits application\nand documents
SPG --> Carrier : Places or administers\napproved specialty risk

Carrier --> SPG : Capacity,\nguidelines and authority
SPG --> Agent : Quote, terms,\nstatus and documents
Agent --> Insured : Presents coverage\nand pricing

note bottom of SPG
  SPG operating businesses may perform
  MGA, wholesale or program functions.
  The exact model can vary by program.
end note

@enduml